23:50.100 --> 23:51.810
It'll depend on the pay.

23:50.680 --> 23:54.240
Do dragons not normally travel in flights?

23:51.380 --> 23:53.020
That's some terrible luck.

23:52.050 --> 23:54.450
We're the party of heroes.

23:53.580 --> 23:55.850
I'm so bored, I could die.

23:54.470 --> 23:56.330
That's a tall order.

23:55.000 --> 23:57.630
I've looked up to him since I was a child.

23:56.490 --> 23:58.200
What's written in it?

23:57.540 --> 23:59.990
Episode 37







Himmel's Memoirs

23:58.200 --> 24:00.040
Himmel's memoirs...
